---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Feeds - Thamara Kandabada";
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle}>
  <body>

    <h1>Feeds</h1>
    
    <p>I have several RSS feeds you can subscribe to. Copy and paste the following feed links to your favourite reader to subscribe. On iOS and macOS, I can recommend <a href="https://www.currentreader.app/" target="_blank">Current</a>.</p>
    
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Notebook:</strong> This is probably the feed you're looking for. It contains all my blog posts. <a href="/notebook">Read the Notebook</a>, <a href="/notebook/rss.xml">View Feed</a></li>
        <ul>
            <li><em>Life:</em> A feed that includes only life updates from my blog. <a href="/">Life Feed</a></li>
            <li><em>The Universe:</em> A feed that includes only posts dealing with broader philosophical themes. <a href="/">The Universe Feed</a></li>
            <li><em>Everything Else:</em> A feed that includes only posts that don't fit into the two sections above. <a href="/">Everything Else Feed</a></li>
            <li><em>Stream:</em> A feed that includes only streamlets—short and frequent updates of what's on my mind. <a href="/">Stream Feed</a></li>
        </ul>
        <li><strong>Gigs:</strong> A feed that contains short updates from every gig that I attend. <a href="/gigs">View the Gigs page</a>, <a href="/">View Feed</a></li>
        <li><strong>Desk:</strong> A feed that documents the evolution of my desk setup. <a href="/desk">View the Desk page</a>, <a href="/">View Feed</a></li>
    </ul>
  </body>
</PageLayout>